## Goal
Produce a principal component analysis (PCA) of the six rnaseq_bulk samples from the gene-level
count matrix, with samples plotted on the first two principal components and coloured by
`condition` (untreated vs treated), so the user can see how the samples group. The analysis
reports the sample coordinates and the variance each component explains; it does not test or
interpret the separation.

## Inputs
